  "answer_text": "# Welch Allyn Ophthalmology Tools\n\n**Welch Allyn** is a globally recognized manufacturer of medical diagnostic equipment, offering a comprehensive portfolio of ophthalmic instruments such as ophthalmoscopes, retinoscopes, and vision screeners. Here is an overview of their key ophthalmology tools:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f 1. PanOptic Plus Ophthalmoscope\nThe Welch Allyn Ophthalmic Sets feature the latest wide-view **PanOptic Plus Ophthalmoscope**. Designed with long-lasting LED lamps and **DuraShock\u2122** for durability, the **Quick Eye\u2122 alignment technology** helps direct the patient's gaze for faster, easier exams. Two lights on the patient side help guide the patient's gaze for better optic disc alignment.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcf1 2. iExaminer System\nThe **iExaminer SmartBracket** allows users to capture and share eye images when paired with a smart device and the iExaminer Pro App. The PanOptic Plus Ophthalmoscope with the iExaminer system can be used during patient eye exams.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd26 3. Streak Retinoscope\nWelch Allyn offers a full range of ophthalmic equipment including **retinoscopes**, ophthalmoscopes, and power handles. The **Welch Allyn 18245 Streak Retinoscope** is a commonly used instrument for objective refraction.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udca1 4. Transilluminator\nThe **Transilluminator** is among Welch Allyn's handheld ophthalmic instruments. It is used to examine the eye's anterior and posterior segments by directing a focused beam of light.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f 5. Standard Direct Ophthalmoscope (Model 11720-L)\nA traditional direct ophthalmoscope used for retinal examination, ideal for educational and clinical settings.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83e\ude7a 6. Spot Vision Screener\nThe **Spot Vision Screener** is a handheld, portable device designed to help quickly and easily detect vision issues on patients as young as six months. Welch Allyn offers a variety of vision screening devices that are designed to be easy to use and accurate, usable by healthcare professionals in schools, doctor's offices, and other settings.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcf8 7. RetinaVue 700 Imager\nAs the latest addition to the RetinaVue care delivery model family, the **RetinaVue 700 Imager** makes retinal imaging and retinal exams simple and affordable in primary care.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd0b 8. Power Handles & Charging Systems\nAll portable ophthalmic sets now include ophthalmoscopes with **long-lasting LED illumination**. Universal Charger and Desk Sets provide convenient drop-in recharging of Welch Allyn desk/well-charger instrument power handles.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\uddc2\ufe0f Additional Accessories & Tools\nWelch Allyn also offers a broad range of accessories including **fixation cards, occluders, prisms, near test cards, eye charts, color tests, exophthalmometers, potential acuity meters**, and more.\n\n---\n\nWelch Allyn (now under **Baxter/Hillrom**) tools are widely trusted in clinical, hospital, and academic settings for their reliability, portability, and innovation in eye care diagnostics. Would you like more details on any specific tool?",
